// The base configuration of the Todo target in Todo.xcodeproj: it reads the signing team from Signing.xcconfig when
// that file exists. Signing.xcconfig is the owner's and git ignores it, so CI and a fresh checkout have none: Xcode
// 27.1 stopped the build when a target's base configuration file was missing, and with this optional include it built
// for the simulator unsigned and printed nothing about it (probed 2026-10-20). Signing.xcconfig.example says what goes
// in it.
#include? "Signing.xcconfig"
